."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"When I finally retire, I've got to build a little cabin by a lake like this. I'll sail and go fishing every day..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And when I'm tired, I'll just lie on the grass, looking at the sky, not thinking about anything... How lovely would that be."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_footsteps_woodfloor","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander has noticed the movement coming from behind, but they do not turn around."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They simply prick up their ears and listen to the approaching footsteps walking on floorboards through the \"rustling of grass and leaves\"..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Until the familiar presence stops right behind them."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You can turn off the projection, thank you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Isn't it nice to get a preview of your retirement life?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sweet dreams will make me lose my way."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I would rather face reality."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As you wish."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{