What? Trying to figure out our location while I'm drunk?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...That's not what I mean."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you want a date, I have to deliver to the best of my ability."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We have the date right here."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander looks around. This rough and grimy depot is not at all a suitable location for a date."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Where's the holographic projector that you shut down earlier?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_NightVision_Start","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"1","raw":"CGDelay"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"658","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Through the magic of holographic projection, it's almost as if they were now on a rooftop in Frankfurt."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Bomber_Flying","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Vroom... The sound of an aircraft taking off can be heard from outside the depot."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander can almost see a commercial airliner taking to the skies."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you like traveling by plane?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The two of them are lying side-by-side on the floor. Lunasia turns her head to look at the Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I neither like nor dislike it. It's a mode of transport for me, just like any other."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I hate planes."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They're always taking people I love away from me and bringing in people I hate."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Who are the ones you love and who are the ones you hate?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't want to talk about them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, then don't you have anyone by your side?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, Bill has always been by my side."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I never quite know how to deal with all the different people around me..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I've gotten used to hiding my feelings, but he's different. To protect me, he'd channel my emotions on top of his own."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Because of that, he always appears hysterical, but I know he's a gentle, thoughtful boy..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I have reservations about that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"One time, I went to watch the planes and forgot that the water was boiling on the stove. By the time I went back inside, the bottom of the kettle was completely burned, and I almost caused a fire..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Mother was furious and kept demanding to know who was responsible. Bill saw me trembling in fear, so he stepped forward and took the blame."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"He took a terrible beating for that... and was locked up for three days..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They should've just beaten him to death.","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I really owe a lot to him..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_va_addingredient","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander props themself up and pours themself a glass of cider to try to get rid of the vicious thoughts in their head."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you have any memory that doesn't concern this person?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sure. I remember during a field combat drill, I led SOP-II and 15 in completing a difficult mission, and we set off to regroup with 16."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I got the rendezvous point wrong and we ended up boarding the wrong plane."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Only when we were almost at the destination did we realize the plane was headed to a mine in Siberia..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"16 was in total panic..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hahahahaha... I can imagine."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"15's face was like thunder, which scared me to death. SOP-II, on the other hand, had a lot of fun. I didn't know what to do at all."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In the end, 16 managed to find us a plane that was willing to give us a lift to where we were supposed to go, but SOP-II insisted on bringing along this insanely massive piece of geode that she had found."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"When we finally dragged her onto the plane, she had to say goodbye to the geode in tears..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She must've obsessed over it for a long time afterwards."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Back when we were on board the Elmo a while ago, I could still hear her muttering about that geode in her sleep."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"At the mention of the Elmo, the Commander takes two gulps of their cider glumly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And that was only because she was undergoing repairs in a repair tank, or she would've sat up and started telling the story again."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's wrong?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander turns toward Lunasia."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Those memories belong to three distinct individuals."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do they...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, the memory about William belongs to Lunasia."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The one about the AR Team's field combat drill is M4's, and the memory on board the Elmo probably belongs to Dandelion."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"When you were recounting them, I could see that you did not realize the switch in perspective at all, so I'm guessing the memories are all jumbled up together inside your neural cloud."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Now the question is... who are you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lunasia looks up, and her eyes come into the light."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Who am I to you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_XXS_kick","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just as the Commander is about to answer, the arm that they've been using to prop themself up suddenly grows slack, and they slump helplessly on the floor."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Lunasia's face comes into view. She gazes silently at the Commander, who is now paralyzed and unable to speak."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Perhaps what I really want isn't a date, but an answer."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Who am I? I don't know the answer to this question either."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But perhaps I don't actually need to try so hard to find an answer, because the fact that I came to be is already an answer in itself, don't you think?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No!","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sorry, Commander, for making you put up with my antics again."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Now sleep. When you wake up, it will be another brand new day."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lunasia!","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The sudden wave of drowsiness stops any of the Commander's words from reaching their lips."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Before the world is completely consumed by oblivion, the Commander musters all their strength and grabs hold of Lunasia's hand..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They can't be sure if they're imagining it, but in the moment before they lose consciousness, the girl seems to pause before lapsing into a strange silence..."}]}]}]}
